== Effect scopes ==
All effect scopes that potentially match multiple subscopes, plus <code>if</code>, can be limited with the <code>limit = { }</code> scope within. For example:

<pre>
every_country = {
    limit = {
        <triggers>
    }
    <effects>
}
</pre>
Scopes that choose one random subscope (e.g. <code>random_owned_province</code>) make their choice after applying the limit.

